    <string name="dialog_privacy_content">" &lt;p>&lt;span style=font-size:16px;>&lt;b>Privacy Notice&lt;/b>&lt;/span>&lt;/p> &lt;p>To provide you with better services, please review our:&lt;/p> &lt;ul> &lt;li>&lt;a href=redirect://privacy style=text-decoration: underline;>Privacy Policy&lt;/a> (Data Collection Policy)&lt;/li> &lt;li>&lt;a href=redirect://protocol style=text-decoration: underline;>Terms of Service&lt;/a> (User Agreement)&lt;/li> &lt;/ul> &lt;p>&lt;span style=font-size:14px;>&lt;b>Data We Collect&lt;/b>&lt;/span>&lt;/p> &lt;p> By accepting, you agree to the collection of certain information to improve our services. This data is collected in a way that does not directly identify you. &lt;/p> &lt;p>&lt;span style=font-size:13px;>&lt;b>Installed Applications&lt;/b>&lt;/span>&lt;/p> &lt;p> Purpose: To enable app cloning features.&lt;br/> Data Collected:&lt;br/> • List of installed apps, package names and version information, etc.&lt;br/> • Basic device compatibility information&lt;br/> Important Notes:&lt;br/> • No personal identifiers such as your name or contacts are collected&lt;br/> • Data is never shared with third parties&lt;br/> • Used only to support app functionality &lt;/p> &lt;p>&lt;span style=font-size:13px;>&lt;b>Crash Diagnostics&lt;/b>&lt;/span>&lt;/p> &lt;p> Purpose: To improve app stability and fix technical issues.&lt;br/> Data Collected:&lt;br/> • Error type and stack trace&lt;br/> • Timestamp of occurrence&lt;br/> • Device model and OS version, etc.&lt;br/> Important Notes:&lt;br/> • No personal or account information is collected&lt;br/> • Data is automatically anonymized&lt;br/> • Used only for technical analysis and app improvement &lt;/p> &lt;p>&lt;span style=font-size:13px;>&lt;b>Advertising&lt;/b>&lt;/span>&lt;/p> &lt;p> This app contains advertisements provided by third-party services (e.g., Google AdMob). &lt;/p> "</string>
